<!--
  [T-android-live-update-completed] Notification small icon for the
  "task completed" resting state of the ongoing foreground-service
  notification / Android 16 Live Update chip.

  Notification small icons are rendered as a monochrome alpha mask: only
  the alpha channel survives, so this is drawn as a solid filled circle
  with the checkmark punched out via evenOdd fill. Drawing the check as a
  separate white path would be invisible — white and black both flatten
  to "opaque" in the mask.
-->
